# News posts — اخبار

When the user asks for a news item (`اخبار` / خبر کوهنوردی), apply **all** of the following.

## Create / publish

1. Framework: `_drafts/news-post-template.md` (never republish template prose).
2. Live file: `_news/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` with `lang: fa-IR`, `dir_attr: rtl`, unique `description`, `date`, YAML `tags`.
3. Body = only the source, in Persian. Complete translation of every narrative paragraph and fact. «فقط متن رو خلاصه کنی» means only the source text — no agent process notes — not a two-sentence stub. Optional link to an existing `/logbook/` report.
4. Photos: **self-host every one**. Download the source article’s photos (`og:image`, article `<figure>`, article `<img>`) into `assets/news/<exact-url-slug>/` — one folder per news item, named exactly like the post file stem — commit them, and reference `/assets/news/<slug>/<file>` from `image:` and every in-body figure. A published page must never load a photo from the source host. Cap width at 1600px and re-encode over-stored files, keeping the original bytes whenever re-encoding grows the file. Translate captions. Skip ads, logos, placeholders, and related-story thumbs. Do not comment `image:` out just because a file is missing — fetch it.
5. Related public UI: only `اخبار مرتبط :` + flat list.
6. Hub `/news/` is two columns on desktop (RTL: right = اخبار جدید / wire, newest first; left = ترجمه مقالات / AAJ 2026, newest `aaj_id` first) and a single stacked list on mobile (wire first). Each column shows 10 items and paginates the rest; the pager recounts on every build when items are added.
7. Homepage `/` is about + four latest teasers from each hub. The climbing-news archive is `/news/` (title: خبر کوهنوردی).
8. Visible dates on the site are Jalali via `_includes/jalali-date.html`.
9. Never invent events, dates, team members, or climb facts.
10. Never publish agent/implementation notes into live HTML. Do not write what you did or didn’t do («عکسی کپی نکردم», fetch/CORS notes, «قله را ادعا نکردم»). News pages have no opening «این خبر را می‌آورم» line and no مترجم/نویسنده byline.
11. International wire agent (GMT 00:00, 06:00, 12:00, 18:00): follow `.cursor/skills/news-wire/SKILL.md`. Each slot, in order: (1) complete translation of every new non-duplicate item from all listed sources since `last_run_utc`; (2) next two AAJ 2026 queue notes; (3) re-check every live `_news/` translation against its source; (4) whole-site SEO via `.cursor/skills/daily-seo-audit/SKILL.md`; (5) `jekyll build` + PR + live `published` overlay until the export has the work. Triple-review before publish. Skip URLs in `_data/news-wire-seen.yml` except when re-checking.

## Do not

- Clone a full گزارش صعود into `_news/`
- Mix news into `_logbook/`
- Keyword-stuff titles or descriptions
- Put «چکار کردی یا نکردی» into the article body
